.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt ADDUSER 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm adduser
.Nd add a user interactively
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar name
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prompts for the same fields as
.Xr useradd 1 :
the login name, full name, home directory, shell, primary group and password.
It uses the same locked
.Pa /etc/passwd ,
.Pa /etc/group
and
.Pa /etc/shadow
transaction; there is no second file format.
.Pp
The default home is
.Pa /home/<name> ,
the default shell is
.Pa /bin/brush ,
and the default primary group is the same-name group.
The home directory is created with mode 0700 and the regular files from
.Pa /etc/skel
are copied into it.
.Pp
The 0.2.0 tools are root-only. The console server echoes input; echo suppression is part of
the terminal-mode work in U3.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/shadow -compact
.It Pa /etc/passwd
account records
.It Pa /etc/group
group records
.It Pa /etc/shadow
password records
.It Pa /etc/skel
home-directory defaults
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr useradd 1 ,
.Xr passwd 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
